OL,5,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,6,     FA doctor has to apply more than
OL,7,     Ften surgical staples to finally
OL,8,     Fclose an open wound on a
OL,9,     Fpensioner's scalp; an elderly man
OL,10,     Ffalls down the stairs.
OL,11,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,12,     FAn ambulance crew bring in a
OL,13,     Fpatient who acts aggressively and
OL,14,     Fis a regular at the hospital. And
OL,15,     Fa 45-year-old suffers
OL,16,     Flife-threatening anaphylaxis from
OL,17,     Fan allergic reaction.
